<title>ESTONIA: TALIBOR, TALIBID INTERBANK RATES STABLE.</title>
<headline>TALIBOR, TALIBID INTERBANK RATES STABLE.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average interbank rates were</p>
<p>unchanged from last week, the central bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The local money market has been very sleepy over the last</p>
<p>week,&quot; Erki Raasuke, head of Hansapank's interest rate products</p>
<p>department, told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;There is still good liquidity on the market at present, but</p>
<p>the banks are worried that the high liquidity will be only for</p>
<p>the short term and do not want to deposit their money in another</p>
<p>bank,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>Raasuke added that trade on the money market over the last</p>
<p>two weeks has been the quietest for the year.</p>
<p>   TALIBOR/TALIBID   1Week	 1Month    3Month</p>
<p>   Aug 13	    4.25/3.25  5.62/4.62  7.00/6.00</p>
<p>   Aug 6	     4.25/3.25  5.62/4.62  7.00/6.00</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
